    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Pizza Clicker</strong>, you will engage in the most exciting activity of the year - clicking. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on the pizza, earn points, and upgrade your inventory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your skills, unlock new types of pizza, and become and become the world's top pizza trader!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is suitable for all ages, professions, and social groups. It will always remain free and guarantees a lot of fun (right?).</p>",
